      "short": "ai_coauthored_code",
      "name_fr": "ai_coauthored_code",
      "story_fr": "Pres de 60% du code produit par les ingenieurs d'Airbnb est desormais co-ecrit avec l'IA, environ le double de la moyenne du secteur selon l'entreprise. Les equipes livrent plus vite et iterent plus rapidement.",
      "story_en": "Nearly 60% of the code Airbnb's engineers produce is now coauthored with AI, roughly twice the industry average by the company's estimate, letting teams ship faster.",
      "signal": "Productivite IA interne",
      "category": "IA",
      "is_short_history": true,
      "_source": "ER/ES",
      "_source_month": null,
      "_source_file": null
    },
    {
      "short": "rnpl_adoption",
      "name_fr": "rnpl_adoption",
      "story_fr": "Le dispositif Reserve Now, Pay Later a depasse 70% d'adoption sur les reservations eligibles apres son lancement US et a represente environ 20% de la valeur brute mondiale des reservations au Q1 2026.",
      "story_en": "Reserve Now, Pay Later exceeded 70% adoption by eligible bookings after its U.S. launch and accounted for roughly 20% of global GBV in Q1 2026.",
      "signal": "Flexibilite paiement",
      "category": "Croissance",
      "is_short_history": true,
